From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Altering Ux
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:00:12 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Rescan the app library only when the app list changes

quickshell's DesktopEntries watches every ancestor of the XDG applications
dirs, $HOME included, so any dotfile save in $HOME re-ran the hidden-entries
scan and the icon index. Remember a key of (id, noDisplay, icon, name) for
every entry and rescan only when that key changes.

Measured on a 4-core host with two CLI agents writing ~/.claude.json:
hidden-entries.sh plus icon finds cost 2.2% of a core (lower bound), with
bursts at 33% CPU; with the key check the scans run only on real app changes.
app-search-test.sh gains three assertions that fail on v4.0.2 and pass here.

Backport to v4.5.0-rc2: app-search-test.sh no longer reads source text (omacom/omarchy#16334), so upstream's source-text check for this change is left out; the change is AppLibrary.qml alone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LRgA37opxda4K7XSxPi4BE

Upstream: omacom/omarchy#14992, its commit 00697bf8c3, taken as is.
Fork commit f8df8d7a3 on asus/v4-5-0-rc1. Replaces our patch 0018,
which throttled the rescan on launcher open instead.
---
 shell/services/AppLibrary.qml | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+)

diff --git a/shell/services/AppLibrary.qml b/shell/services/AppLibrary.qml
index 061fc269c..e008c12ae 100644
--- a/shell/services/AppLibrary.qml
+++ b/shell/services/AppLibrary.qml
@@ -269,9 +269,31 @@ Item {
     onTriggered: root.closeLaunchFeedback(root.launchSerial)
   }
 
+  // DesktopEntries watches every ancestor of the XDG applications dirs, $HOME
+  // included, so any dotfile save there (an editor, a shell history write, an
+  // agent's atomic config rename) emits valuesChanged with the same entries.
+  // Rescan only when an entry the scans depend on was added, removed or
+  // changed; a burst of identical emissions then costs one comparison each.
+  property string desktopAppsKey: ""
+
+  function computeDesktopAppsKey() {
+    var values = DesktopEntries.applications.values || []
+    var parts = []
+    for (var i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {
+      var entry = values[i]
+      if (!entry) continue
+      parts.push([entry.id, entry.noDisplay ? "1" : "0", entry.icon || "", entry.name || ""].join("\u001f"))
+    }
+    parts.sort()
+    return parts.join("\u001e")
+  }
+
   Connections {
     target: DesktopEntries.applications
     function onValuesChanged() {
+      var key = root.computeDesktopAppsKey()
+      if (key === root.desktopAppsKey) return
+      root.desktopAppsKey = key
       hiddenEntryScan.running = true
       iconIndexDebounce.restart()
       root.appsChanged()
@@ -279,6 +301,7 @@ Item {
   }
 
   Component.onCompleted: {
+    root.desktopAppsKey = root.computeDesktopAppsKey()
     hiddenEntryScan.running = true
     iconIndexScan.running = true
   }
